OL,3,GNEWSADispersal and face-cover bans in
OL,4,Aplace for protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dispersal order has been imposed by
OL,7,FEssex Police in connection with a
OL,8,Fpotential demonstration against the
OL,9,Fhousing of asylum seekers at a former
OL,10,Fairbase.
OL,12,FThe force said a dispersal order was
OL,13,Fbeing put in place in the Braintree
OL,14,Fdistrict on Saturday afternoon
OL,15,F"following concerns about potential
OL,16,Fanti-social behaviour" at MDP
OL,17,FWethersfield.
OL,19,FPolice added they would also be
OL,20,Finvoking a further order banning face
OL,21,Fcoverings or attempts by people in the
OL,22,Farea to conceal their identity.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
